  /* pure: the note this list is showing, and why. The order is the reader's
     attention: the row under the pointer or the keyboard, then the layer the
     page is holding as its subject, then the class that most recently arrived
     in the frame, and where nothing claims it the sentence that explains every
     count on the plate, which is therefore never below the fold. */
